            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Fred Cannon"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love this cheeseball, make it often for parties, etc. Frequently I will add about 1/2 can of crushed pineapple to it. The combination of the sweetness of the pineapple and the saltiness of the olives play off each other well.",
