              "name": "Michele DeBruin Yahr"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was really tasty. However, it was too soft for me to make a cheese ball out of it... in fact, my family jokingly called it a 'cheese flat'! I ended up skipping the nuts and served it as a dip instead. I will definitely will make it again as a dip.",
