              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KittyFanatic"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is the cheese ball my mother used to make every year, only without the olives. (They can override and change the flavor of everything.) I was going to add \"but my mom used worcestershire sauce in hers\" when I re-read this and saw it was in there! Just add a little more of the sauce, a little bit of garlic powder (or Mrs. Dash garlic and herb) for a really great cracker spread. Yum!",
